        "event": "Hydrologic Outlook",
        "headline": "Hydrologic Outlook issued August 25 at 3:48PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "ESFAFC\n\nLocations:\n\n* Yentna and Skwentna River basins\n* Rivers, creeks, and streams with headwaters along the western\nTalkeetna Mountains.\n\nTiming:\n\n* First Round - Now through tomorrow Morning\n* Second Round - Late Thursday Night through Saturday Evening\n\nRainfall:\n\n* Widespread rainfall of 0.5 to 1.5 inches of rain is likely (70-80%)\nacross the Susitna Valley late Monday Night through Wednesday\nmorning. The highest amounts are very likely (80%-90%) to occur\nfrom Petersville east to Talkeetna ",
        "severity": "Unknown",
        "certainty": "Possible",
        "urgency": "Future",
